                        "note": "null"
                    },
                    {
                        "key": "ap-usageNote-en",
                        "value": "NOTE",
                        "note": "By this is meant a real-world object from traffic, i.e. a Vehicle or TrafficParticipant or a RoadSegment or similar over which traffic takes place. This does not include: TrafficSamplingObjects such as TrafficMeasurementPoints or TrafficMeasurementSections, which are the objects that sample the traffic domain. ATTENTION: This class is abstract, ie it may not be instantiated. Instead, use cubclasses such as RoadSegment, Lane, Vehicle, etc."
