                        "key": "ap-label-en",
                        "value": "TrafficObject",
                        "note": "null"
                    },
                    {
                        "key": "ap-definition-en",
                        "value": "Object on which or along which traffic occurs or that is part of traffic.",
                        "note": "null"
                    },
                    {
                        "key": "ap-usageNote-en",
                        "value": "NOTE",
                        "note": "ATTENTION: This class is abstract, it must be specialized as a TrafficDomainObject or as a TrafficSamplingObject. As a Traffic DomainObject if the measurement directly relates to the object you want to observe (e.g. a RoadSegment or a Vehicle, etc.) or as a TrafficSamplingObject if the measurement is done indirectly (e.g. via a TrafficMeasuringPoint located along a RoadSegment)."
                    }
                ],
