                        "note": "null"
                    },
                    {
                        "key": "ap-usageNote-en",
                        "value": "NOTE",
                        "note": "This is the actual observedObject. If direct observation is not possible, we observe a representative sample, the so-called SamplingObject. In that case, the DomainObject is the sampledObject. REMARK: This class is purely informative and needs to be substituted in practice by a class from the domain. E.g. in the domain TraficMeasurements, the DomainObject could be an instance of a RoadSegment or a Vehicle."
                    }
