                        "key": "ap-usageNote-en",
                        "value": "NOTE",
                        "note": "These components can be Systems in themselves. They are Systems that realize an ObservationProcedure (typically a Sensor) or with which a Sampling procedure is carried out (e.g. a drilling rig) or they are Platforms like the Device on which the Sensor is mounted. REMARK: For more details about this class see <a href=\"https://data.vlaanderen.be/doc/applicatieprofiel/sensoren-en-bemonstering/\">AP Sensors and Sampling</a>."
